{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-9","kind":"proposition","title":"角平分线的尺规作图","englishTitle":"To bisect a given rectilineal angle.","book":1,"number":9,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.9","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.9/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":9,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-9@raw-d6dac321962ee792","contentId":"euclid-1-9","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d6dac321962ee792ef8655a6d8097c8d7135c290db2b660ce6b7ca9a28a1f072","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-9.statement","euclid-1-9.construction.1","euclid-1-9.proof.1","euclid-1-9.construction.2","euclid-1-9.proof.2","euclid-1-9.proof.3","euclid-1-9.proof.4","euclid-1-9.proof.5","euclid-1-9.conclusion","euclid-1-9.historical.1","euclid-1-9.historical.2","euclid-1-9.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-9.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-9","revisionId":"euclid-1-9@raw-d6dac321962ee792","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"903e83ab5b815adc7b82dcaccd1badffa98596292208742c636134f47fa00381","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To bisect a given rectilineal angle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将给定的直角分成两部分。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"有直线角，求两平分之。"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"给定一个平角，求其平分线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-9.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-9","revisionId":"euclid-1-9@raw-d6dac321962ee792","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"566b92afd3e74486e6592c90c5fa0bb8179f988030ca55163271035cddb3e7bb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the angle BAC be the given rectilineal angle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让角度BAC 成为给定的直线角度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-9.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-9","revisionId":"euclid-1-9@raw-d6dac321962ee792","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ae88cea1480b21ca0e81f485afcf6723d5ada26e10a0e863c21d0bfa981485ab","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Thus it is required to bisect it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,它必须分成两部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-9.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-1-9","revisionId":"euclid-1-9@raw-d6dac321962ee792","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fa557be263eaa7a495af80cb3dcc098d778308d3ccf0f3391efa97202f18296d","citations":["euclid-1-3"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let a point D be taken at random on AB; let AE be cut off from AC equal to AD; [[I. 3](/principles/euclid-1-3)] let DE be joined, and on DE let the equilateral triangle DEF be constructed; let AF be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB随机选取D点;AE从AC切除,等于AD;DE合用,DE合用;等边三角形DEF合用。（相关点与线段：AF） [[I. 3](/principles/euclid-1-3)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-9.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-9","revisionId":"euclid-1-9@raw-d6dac321962ee792","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6800510772fd099ccbec0e2b69e71ad0b97fbb055b9c4b1c8b8d5ec6cd3a2e5e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that the angle BAC has been bisected by the straight line AF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,BAC角被AF线线分了两部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-9.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-9","revisionId":"euclid-1-9@raw-d6dac321962ee792","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"82c631d183db23301438da2bc4ab521bb31db49eca25c99a3e50b212e1cb659c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since AD is equal to AE, and AF is common, the two sides DA, AF are equal to the two sides EA, AF respectively."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为AD等于AE,AF是共同的,双方DA,AF是分别相等于双方EA,AF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-9.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-9","revisionId":"euclid-1-9@raw-d6dac321962ee792","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d85fd3d7ee20f54bc2a1178e21f3e00d620201f044885e855fefe94a0cdc0b4f","citations":["euclid-1-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the base DF is equal to the base EF; therefore the angle DAF is equal to the angle EAF. [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"底边 DF等于底边 EF,因此角度DAF等于角度EAF。 [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-9.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-1-9","revisionId":"euclid-1-9@raw-d6dac321962ee792","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c9201a85469ee097c0c7aed090abc3e3138774d4f0e089e3afc6314f11a54653","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the given rectilineal angle BAC has been bisected by the straight line AF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,给定的直角BAC被直线AF分界线分割。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-9.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-9","revisionId":"euclid-1-9@raw-d6dac321962ee792","order":8,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6e432e38b0000ec6ee99e2e8d764f4fbbb98aaaef6b326a175b8cd06205cc0c2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"所求作图完成。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-9.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-9","revisionId":"euclid-1-9@raw-d6dac321962ee792","order":9,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7279dfddca7ec157d30ffbc48f5007d913b1e8bd04179fe495d53eadb0e02f50","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"有直线角，求两平分之。"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"给定一个平角，求其平分线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-9.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-9","revisionId":"euclid-1-9@raw-d6dac321962ee792","order":10,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b34dfdbc2f275277349279a78c26e31810fee596a24cf5ff361778777c1efa4a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：丁甲己与戊甲己两三角形之甲丁与甲戊两线等，甲己同是一线，戊己与丁己两底又等〈何言“两底等”？初从戊丁底作此三角平形，此二线为腰各等戊丁故〉，则丁甲己与戊甲己两角必等〈本篇八〉。"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：丁甲己与戊甲己两三角形之甲丁与甲戊两线等，甲己同是一线，戊己与丁己两底又等〈何言“两底等”？初从戊丁底作此三角平形，此二线为腰各等戊丁故〉，则丁甲己与戊甲己两角必等〈本篇八〉。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-9.source","contentId":"euclid-1-9","revisionId":"euclid-1-9@raw-d6dac321962ee792","order":11,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bb1119f86875ff89075def9b16fe0002f5f5bf81675f7e0a66e886ca7faeed0f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.9/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.9\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-1-9:euclid-1-3:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-9","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-9.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-3","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.9","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.9/","sourceLabel":"I. 3"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-1-9:euclid-1-8:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-9","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-9.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-8","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.9","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.9/","sourceLabel":"I. 8"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-1-10:euclid-1-9:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-10","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-10.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-9","type":"depends_on","pro